/// M31 HISTORY-063 "Review manifest: run shape".
/// Source: tests/host-discrimination/admission_test.go
/// symbol TestReviewManifestCoversPrototypes (L126-175)
/// call shape plus the nine diagnostic wordings plus
/// the five site tallies.
/// Disposition: migrate (this row owns the
/// TestReviewManifestCoversPrototypes offline pact
/// as reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays
/// until the integrator retires it after every linked
/// row, variant, environment plus control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the run shape: the Go name,
/// the eleven call spellings, the nine wordings, plus
/// the five tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): name pins
/// hold the L126 ident; call pins hold Go selector
/// bytes; wording pins hold Go quoted bytes; counts
/// pin ints tallied from the Go sites.
/// test-name pins TestReviewManifestCoversPrototypes
/// (L126); dir-call pins testDir (L127);
/// read-call pins os.ReadFile (L128);
/// unmarshal-call pins json.Unmarshal (L133);
/// join-call pins filepath.Join (L128, L148, L153
/// plus L165); stat-call pins os.Stat (L148);
/// read-dir-call pins os.ReadDir (L154);
/// is-not-exist-call pins os.IsNotExist (L155);
/// is-dir-call pins entry.IsDir (L162);
/// name-call pins entry.Name (L162 plus L165);
/// suffix-call pins strings.HasSuffix (L162);
/// fatalf-call pins t.Fatalf (L130, L134, L137,
/// L142, L146, L149, L159, L168 plus L171);
/// word-read-manifest pins read manifest: %v (L130);
/// word-parse-manifest pins parse manifest: %v (L134);
/// word-status pins manifest status = %q, want
/// UNREVIEWED-PROTOTYPE (L137); word-twice pins
/// manifest lists %q twice (L142);
/// word-entry-status pins manifest entry %q status =
/// %q, want unreviewed (L146); word-dangles pins
/// manifest entry %q dangles: %v (L149);
/// word-read-tree pins read %s: %v (L159; plus L81
/// in HISTORY-062 scope); word-missing pins prototype
/// %q missing from manifest (L168);
/// word-proto-status pins prototype %q status = %q,
/// want unreviewed (L171); fatalf-site-count pins
/// int (9); diagnostic-site-count pins int (9);
/// join-site-count pins int (4); suffix-site-count
/// pins int (2); name-site-count pins int (3).
/// Facet map (run in Go order): test-name, dir-call,
/// read-call, unmarshal-call, join-call, stat-call,
/// read-dir-call, is-not-exist-call, is-dir-call,
/// name-call, suffix-call, fatalf-call,
/// word-read-manifest, word-parse-manifest,
/// word-status, word-twice, word-entry-status,
/// word-dangles, word-read-tree, word-missing,
/// word-proto-status, fatalf-site-count,
/// diagnostic-site-count, join-site-count,
/// suffix-site-count, name-site-count.
/// The anchor legs live in
/// history-063-base-semantics.can; the sweep roots
/// live in history-063-roots-green.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; default
/// plus seeded drifts only).
/// Environment: no gates (row lists zero environment
/// gates; offline only).
/// Logical gates SUITE/DOC/FILES/BUILD bind at P23;
/// no live run now.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline default bound (no
/// Go timeout in this row; binds at P23 like the M11
/// no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (P23 accept gate
/// unmet).
